WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,298 --> 00:00:00,721
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,218 --> 00:00:03,453
A muddy blob is splashing the lemonade stand!

3
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:06,336
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:06,833 --> 00:00:08,254
This is Episode 46.

5
00:00:08,751 --> 00:00:09,685
Mud on the lemons.

6
00:00:10,182 --> 00:00:11,020
Mud on the cups.

7
00:00:11,517 --> 00:00:12,275
Maya needs help.

8
00:00:12,772 --> 00:00:13,796
Here comes the sieve gate.

9
00:00:14,293 --> 00:00:14,954
A little wall.

10
00:00:15,451 --> 00:00:16,007
A little gate.

11
00:00:16,504 --> 00:00:19,207
The gate has one job: it checks everyone who knocks.

12
00:00:19,704 --> 00:00:20,995
Three little friends float up.

13
00:00:21,492 --> 00:00:22,218
The gate looks.

14
00:00:22,715 --> 00:00:23,190
Friends!

15
00:00:23,687 --> 00:00:24,801
The gate swings open.

16
00:00:25,298 --> 00:00:25,709
Come in!

17
00:00:26,206 --> 00:00:27,204
And it closes again.

18
00:00:27,701 --> 00:00:28,949
Now the blob charges.

19
00:00:29,446 --> 00:00:30,172
The gate looks.

20
00:00:30,669 --> 00:00:31,297
Not a friend!

21
00:00:31,794 --> 00:00:32,715
The gate shuts tight.

22
00:00:33,212 --> 00:00:33,628
Bounce!

23
00:00:34,125 --> 00:00:34,511
Splat!

24
00:00:35,008 --> 00:00:35,771
Nothing gets in.

25
00:00:36,268 --> 00:00:37,372
The blob puts on a hat.

26
00:00:37,869 --> 00:00:38,321
Sneaky.

27
00:00:38,818 --> 00:00:39,716
The gate looks again.

28
00:00:40,213 --> 00:00:41,124
Still not a friend.

29
00:00:41,621 --> 00:00:42,205
Still shut.

30
00:00:42,702 --> 00:00:43,366
Friends get in.

31
00:00:43,863 --> 00:00:44,614
Mud stays out.

32
00:00:45,111 --> 00:00:46,103
Every single time.

33
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:47,970
Maya's stand stays clean.

34
00:00:48,467 --> 00:00:49,407
That is the sieve gate.

35
00:00:49,904 --> 00:00:51,785
It checks who is knocking before they get in.

36
00:00:52,282 --> 00:00:53,536
Now you know WAF!

37
00:00:54,033 --> 00:00:55,786
Check out the Cloud Town book series.

38
00:00:56,283 --> 00:00:57,111
Link in the bio.

39
00:00:57,608 --> 00:00:58,479
See you next time!

